{"step_index":2869,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-29T07:19:47Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-29T03:19:47-04:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-29T03:19:47-04:00\nFile Path: `file:///Users/ajoxendine68/Desktop/SSOT_Agentic_Brain/ops/scripts/full_team_deliberation_roundtable.py`\nTotal Lines: 173\nTotal Bytes: 5740\nShowing lines 100 to 173\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n100:         chunk = turns[start : start + 3]\n101:         if len(chunk) == 3:\n102:             chunks.append(chunk)\n103:     return chunks\n104: \n105: \n106: def dispatch_chunk(chunk: list[dict[str, str]]) -> None:\n107:     payload = json.dumps(chunk, ensure_ascii=True)\n108:     lead_agent = chunk[0][\"agent\"]\n109:     subprocess.run([sys.executable, str(SPEAK_SCRIPT), lead_agent, payload], check=True, stdin=subprocess.DEVNULL)\n110: \n111: \n112: def write_journal(mode: str, objective: str, turns: list[dict[str, str]], triad_count: int) -> None:\n113:     ROUND_JOURNAL.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n114:     entry = {\n115:         \"timestamp\": now_iso(),\n116:         \"mode\": mode,\n117:         \"objective\": objective,\n118:         \"turn_count\": len(turns),\n119:         \"triad_count\": triad_count,\n120:         \"agents\": [turn[\"agent\"] for turn in turns],\n121:         \"quality_guardrails\": {\n122:             \"no_placeholder\": True,\n123:             \"no_theatrical_roleplay\": True,\n124:             \"no_duplicates\": True,\n125:         },\n126:     }\n127:     with ROUND_JOURNAL.open(\"a\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as handle:\n128:         handle.write(json.dumps(entry, ensure_ascii=True) + \"\\n\")\n129: \n130: \n131: def run_roundtable(objective: str, turns_file: str | None) -> None:\n132:     if sys.platform != \"